Week One

  The starter did nothing. I fed it anyway.

Week Two

  Bubbles. A flat loaf, but it tasted fine.

  // Note to self: write down the flour brand next time.


Lessons

   1. Keep the starter warm.
   2. Weigh everything.
   3. Be patient.
